# Product name

The product name is **TaxSaathi**. Use that exact spelling in code, UI copy, API titles, prompts, comments, and docs.

```text
// ❌ BAD
title="CA Tax Copilot API"
<h1>CA Tax Copilot</h1>

// ✅ GOOD
title="TaxSaathi API"
<h1>TaxSaathi</h1>
```

Do not rename TaxSaathi to "CA Tax Copilot", "Tax Copilot", or "Copilot". The workspace folder may stay `CA-Tax-Copilot`; that path is not the product name.
